# 统一换行：仓库内以 LF 存储；Windows 检出时由 git 按类型转换
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 设备页面与它生成的头文件：CI 用 `embed_console.py --check` 逐字节比对，
# 换行只要随平台变一次就会红。两边都钉死 LF。
web/device.html text eol=lf
firmware/include/console_html.h text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary